# DataSipper: Stream selection and grouping system
#
# This patch implements the stream selection engine that allows users to
# group and route network data streams based on patterns, endpoints, and rules.
#
# Affects:
# - components/datasipper/stream/ (new directory)
# - components/datasipper/stream/stream_selector.h (new file)
# - components/datasipper/stream/stream_selector.cc (new file)
# - components/datasipper/stream/stream_rule.h (new file)
# - components/datasipper/stream/stream_group.h (new file)

